# wt.conf -- WindTunnelSuite data-vault configuration
# Copy this file to wt.conf (same dir) and set your NAS mount.
# WT3D_VAULT accepts a mapped drive (Git Bash form) or a UNC path, e.g.:
#   WT3D_VAULT=Z:/windtunnel-vault
#   WT3D_VAULT=//nas/share/windtunnel-vault
# The tool only ever writes inside <WT3D_VAULT>/windtunnel-suite/.
# Environment variable WT3D_VAULT overrides this file.
